---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.name}: security engineer by day, photographer and filmmaker the rest of the time, based in New York.`}>
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>Hi, I'm Johnny.</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Photographer and developer in New York.</p>

    <p>
      By day, security: Tines automation, privileged access, infrastructure reviews. It
      shapes how I build. Systems that outlast their builder. Tokens, not one-off CSS.
      Settings the client can edit. Docs that say why.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of that lately is for
      <a href={url('/projects/gotham-brand-system')}>Gotham Knights RFC</a>, New York's
      LGBT rugby club. Brand system, website, storefront, drag show.
    </p>

    <p>
      The photos and video are the work I'd make anyway. People and places around me.
      Next: queer athletes, and the people who hold their communities together.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or find me on
      {site.links.map((l, i) => (
        <>
          <a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="me noopener">{l.label}</a>{i < site.links.length - 1 ? ', ' : '.'}
        </>
      ))}
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
